{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_523_rs_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_523_rs_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "4227d8787204bc7c02ef2ac8f3c5961fbb26108db57dce9e1db3a4b32e32b78e", "ja": "M@STERS OF IDOL WORLD 2025\nDAY2を無事に終えたジュリアからの\n留守番電話です。", "zh": "这是顺利结束了M@STERS OF IDOL WORLD 2025\nDAY2的茱莉亚发来的\n电话留言。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_523_rs_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_523_rs_02_1000_050jul", "source_sha256": "8d8d6b285dbcc8a52497df6c6485f84dd92fe47d7bbb8583f9ce55820d8f3425", "ja": "おーい、{$P$}、生きてるか？\nあたしだよ。ジュリアだ。", "zh": "喂——{$P$}，还活着吗？\n是我，茱莉亚。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_523_rs_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_523_rs_02_1001_050jul", "source_sha256": "f2556dfdc70613ed7bec9499af49adb02eb353e983c0d6f2a7751a784a3a163b", "ja": "今日は撤収作業で忙しいだろうから、\n留守電入れとくよ。ま、暇になったら聞いてくれ。", "zh": "今天你应该正忙着收拾撤场工作，\n我就先给你留个语音留言吧。等有空了再听。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_523_rs_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_523_rs_02_1002_050jul", "source_sha256": "aa9f7d96927886ce9a36f1a76f25621b01d8653ad00ad17838281a2ecae9badd", "ja": "といっても、大したことじゃなくてさ。\nまぁ、その……。ただのお礼だ。", "zh": "不过，也不是什么大不了的事。嗯，那个……只是想道个谢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_523_rs_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_523_rs_02_1003_050jul", "source_sha256": "061215e98b979b5f4e6e7f39dda731f8e603c219e7409b8ab0c479b7edc3794b", "ja": "もちろん、今日の大阪での合同ライブのこと。\nアンタはお礼なんかいらないっていうだろうけどな。", "zh": "当然是指今天在大阪的联合演出那件事。\n虽然你肯定会说用不着道谢就是了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_523_rs_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_523_rs_02_1004_050jul", "source_sha256": "8d3dddf7b06e72cf00ade43a62b95e95234203ffadc3d53b95ba05b8c30c0ec1", "ja": "だが、留守電だから言ったもん勝ちだ。\nへへっ、残念だったな。バカP。", "zh": "不过，反正是语音留言，说什么都不会有人反驳。\n嘿嘿，真遗憾啊，笨蛋P。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_523_rs_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_523_rs_02_1005_050jul", "source_sha256": "c898713c78eb66ef5410c391ec0befc2f7182f952b22a1cce322e34a4a9149bb", "ja": "いや……だってさ。路上で歌ってたあたしが、\n今日はあんなデカいハコで歌ってたんだぜ？", "zh": "不是……因为嘛。以前还在街头唱歌的我，今天可是登上了那么大的场馆啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_523_rs_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_523_rs_02_1006_050jul", "source_sha256": "20bbf41d2725dd2686db979e7b1a499854801d8e2fd01cb326dd860732846103", "ja": "お礼の一つや二つは言いたくなるだろ、普通……。\nてことで、一方的に言わせてもらう。……こほん。", "zh": "一般来说，总会想说上一两句感谢吧……  \n所以，就让我单方面说几句。……咳咳。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_523_rs_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_523_rs_02_1007_050jul", "source_sha256": "bd0392e633c5eb5d8e38e6aeb498f2bb9cf48e84016985c49faf589d9b0e49e1", "ja": "あたしと出会ってくれて……\nウチらみんなと出会ってくれて。", "zh": "能和我相遇……\n能和我们大家相遇。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_523_rs_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_523_rs_02_1008_050jul", "source_sha256": "590c1d110b21809b040f5a42c4aa38c78fcef4c2fef53772a16784ac1eb4d9df", "ja": "ほんと……感謝してるんだ。\nありがとな……。{$P$}。", "zh": "真的……非常感谢你。\n谢谢你……{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_523_rs_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_523_rs_02_1009_050jul", "source_sha256": "5f8d3a7ec46559b3ef64f34527b95bb53a2ca5f0a6b74dd424bb57298b8dc338", "ja": "ん……。マズい……。マジになり過ぎた……。\nむちゃくちゃ恥ずかしいテンションだった気がする～！", "zh": "嗯……糟了……太认真过头了……感觉刚才的情绪也太羞耻了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_523_rs_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_523_rs_02_1010_050jul", "source_sha256": "9eb907c249d67608bede41e02d60043e18f5f72b75c2afab1a0f2d6b53b0d2cc", "ja": "あ、あんたも聞いてて恥ずかしかったよな？\nそうだよな？　こっちが死ぬほど恥ずかしいんだし！！", "zh": "啊、你听着也觉得很羞耻吧？\n对吧？我这边都快羞耻死了！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
